{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2d43c8b4-194b-8164-b533-b2fa0fd4a75e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T17:53:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good evening. Excuse me, I know it is after the City Hall hours, I am calling the storm line like the recording said. Is this okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. Monday evening, so the main office is closed, but this line's open. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, I want to report a storm drain. It is gurgling, making a wet noise, and a smell of sewer comes up from it. Very bad smell. It started after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gurgling drain, sewer smell. Which storm, the one Friday into Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one, two days ago. And the water is still sitting there. [pause] I am sorry, I am on the speakerphone, my hands are not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I hear you fine. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, it is 151 Bridge Street, in the Point. The drain is right in front, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One fifty-one Bridge Street, drain out front, gurgling, odor. Got it. Is the water coming up into the street or the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the street, not in the house. But it is near the water, and children walk here after school, and people with their dogs. Please, I worry somebody will get sick or slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:52:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense. I'll note the foot traffic. Anything else, like is it blocking the whole lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, only the corner by the curb. Please, may I ask something? Do the crews work on the weekend? Because the storm was the weekend and nobody came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get out after storms, but I can't tell you exactly when they'll hit your block. I'm putting it in as a request tonight so the crew lead sees it first thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please forgive me, you sound new, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You caught me. I just switched jobs, so I'm still learning where everything is. But this one I can log, no problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, can you read the address back to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. One fifty-one Bridge Street, The Point, storm drain gurgling with a sewer smell since the weekend storm. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. Got it. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T17:53:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Good night."
    }
  ],
